        "original_id": "2087cb97-fd1d-5707-b8bb-26451288a2a4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lari White, Chuck Cannon, Vicky McGehee, Danny Gokey\n- Songs and Albums: \"I Will Not Say Goodbye\", My Best Days\n- Organizations and Shows: American Idol, You Can Be a Star, The Nashville Network, Hot Country Songs\n\nFacts:\n- Lari White was born on May 13, 1965, and she is an American country music artist and actress.\n- In 1988, Lari White first gained national attention by winning You Can Be a Star, a talent competition that aired on The Nashville Network.\n- \"I Will Not Say Goodbye\" was written by Lari White, Chuck Cannon, and Vicky McGehee.\n- \"I Will Not Say Goodbye\" was recorded by Danny Gokey, an American Idol season 8 finalist.\n- \"I Will Not Say Goodbye\" and another single from the album My Best Days both reached the Top 40 on Hot Country Songs.",
